{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "id": "research-external",
  "scope": "system",
  "title": "向外调研",
  "description": "通用外部调研系统管线：基于 Pi + MiniMax，从 URL、代码仓库、官方文档、论文、Wiki、新闻、市场数据等外部来源动态规划 scouts，并由系统节点写入 wiki/research。",
  "version": 2,
  "readonly": false,
  "metadata": {
    "tags": [
      "system",
      "research",
      "external",
      "pi",
      "resource-bundle"
    ],
    "owner": "blackboard",
    "created_by": "codex",
    "updated_by": "codex",
    "run_policy": {
      "allow_concurrent_runs": true,
      "max_concurrent_runs": 3,
      "queue_enabled": true,
      "max_queue_wait_ms": 7200000,
      "queue_timeout_retry_enabled": true,
      "max_queue_timeout_retries": 5
    }
  },
  "inputs": [
    {
      "id": "input",
      "label": "Search / Research Prompt",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "description": "User prompt for this generic external search/research run."
    },
    {
      "id": "primary-urls",
      "label": "Primary Sources",
      "type": "json",
      "default": [],
      "description": "Primary external URLs, repositories, docs, papers, wiki pages, news links, market/finance links, issue links, datasets, or search directions. Can be empty if the prompt itself includes sources."
    },
    {
      "id": "wiki-slice",
      "label": "Wiki Slice",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "",
      "description": "Optional internal context excerpt to include in the resource bundle."
    },
    {
      "id": "skills",
      "label": "Skills",
      "type": "json",
      "default": [
        "external-research",
        "research-output-contract"
      ],
      "description": "Skill ids expected by this graph; static node config also injects these skills for Pi."
    },
    {
      "id": "run-marker",
      "label": "Run Marker",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "research-external",
      "description": "Staging marker and default output filename prefix."
    },
    {
      "id": "output-slug",
      "label": "Output Slug",
      "type": "string",
      "default": "research-external",
      "description": "Final markdown filename under wiki/research, without .md."
    }
  ],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "start",
      "type": "start",
      "label": "Start",
      "position": {
        "x": -900,
        "y": -260
      },
      "config": {},
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prompt-input",
      "type": "data_value",
      "label": "Research Prompt",
      "position": {
        "x": -900,
        "y": -40
      },
      "config": {
        "preset": "data_value",
        "value": "{{inputs.input}}",
        "value_type": "string"
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "value",
          "label": "Value",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "string",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "external-sources",
      "type": "data_value",
      "label": "Primary External Sources",
      "position": {
        "x": -900,
        "y": 120
      },
      "config": {
        "preset": "data_value",
        "value": "{{inputs.primary-urls}}",
        "value_type": "json"
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "value",
          "label": "Value",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ],
      "description": "Prioritized source hints for external search/research scouts."
    },
    {
      "id": "resource-bundle",
      "type": "data_value",
      "label": "ResourceBundle",
      "description": "Structured L2 resource bundle for generic external search/research 增强 LLM 节点 execution.",
      "position": {
        "x": -900,
        "y": 300
      },
      "config": {
        "preset": "resource_bundle",
        "value_type": "json",
        "value": {
          "schema_version": 1,
          "kind": "task_graph_llm_resource_bundle",
          "task": {
            "type": "external_research",
            "input": "{{inputs.input}}",
            "run-marker": "{{inputs.run-marker}}",
            "output_slug": "{{inputs.output-slug}}"
          },
          "data_sources": {
            "source_urls": "{{inputs.primary-urls}}",
            "wiki_slice": "{{inputs.wiki-slice}}"
          },
          "runtime": {
            "project": "{{env.project}}",
            "workspace": "{{env.workspace}}",
            "scratch_dir": "{{env.workspace}}/.staging/external-research/{{inputs.run-marker}}"
          },
          "skills": "{{inputs.skills}}",
          "contracts": {
            "source_policy": "Prioritize data_sources.source_urls when present, then follow directly relevant external repositories, docs, papers, wiki pages, news, market/finance data, datasets, issues, or search results as needed. Distinguish source facts from model inference and preserve publication/data dates when relevant.",
            "scout_output": "JSON object with findings[], risks[], coverage_notes[]. source_anchors should be URLs, repo files, docs, papers, commits, issues, wiki pages, news articles, datasets, or market/finance source anchors.",
            "write_policy": "LLM nodes may use scratch_dir for temporary exploration, but final research reports must be written only by system_write_output under wiki/research.",
            "final_output_dir": "wiki/research",
            "final_output_path": "{{env.workspace}}/wiki/research/{{inputs.output-slug}}.md",
            "llm_input": "resource_bundle"
          },
          "upstream_artifacts": {}
        }
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "value",
          "label": "Value",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "plan-scouts",
      "type": "llm",
      "label": "Plan External Search Scouts",
      "description": "LLM creates a generic external search/research ScoutPlan from task intent and source hints.",
      "position": {
        "x": -560,
        "y": -260
      },
      "config": {
        "agent": "native",
        "inputs": {
          "resource_bundle": "{{data.resource-bundle.output}}"
        },
        "model": "minimax-cn/MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed",
        "output": {
          "artifact_type": "json",
          "required": true
        },
        "prompt": {
          "mode": "inline",
          "template": "你是通用 external search/research Scout Planner。\n\n你只负责把 ResourceBundle 转成 ScoutPlan。不要输出 TaskGraphDefinition，不要输出 nodes/edges，不要输出 graph_mutations，不要 Markdown，不要解释。\n\nResourceBundle JSON：\n{{inputs.resource_bundle}}\n\n输出必须是一个 JSON 对象：\n{\n  \"task_type\": \"external_research\",\n  \"question\": \"用户真正要调研的问题\",\n  \"merge_goal\": \"最终报告需要回答的核心问题\",\n  \"scouts\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"kebab-case-stable-id\",\n      \"title\": \"短标题\",\n      \"goal\": \"这个 scout 要回答的具体子问题，以及需要保留的 evidence/source anchors\",\n      \"paths\": [\"URL、仓库路径、文档路径、论文、wiki、新闻、行情/财务数据、issue、搜索方向或其他外部资料定位\"]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n\n规划规则：\n1. scouts 数量 2 到 5 个，根据 ResourceBundle.task.input 和 data_sources.source_urls 动态拆分。\n2. id 必须是 kebab-case，只能使用小写字母、数字和连字符；不要把某个产品名写死成固定拆分。\n3. paths 可以包含 ResourceBundle.data_sources.source_urls 中的 URL，也可以包含你认为必须探索的 repo path、docs path、paper、wiki、news、market/finance data、issue 或搜索方向。\n4. 根据任务语义动态覆盖：任务相关的来源可信度、时间范围、官方叙事/设计目标、仓库或文档结构、核心机制/API/示例、事实数据、行情/财务指标、新闻脉络、可迁移设计、限制风险。不要写死某个产品、组织、项目、行业或数据源的专属章节。\n5. scout 可以自由探索外部来源，但必须标注 source anchors；不要把推断写成事实。\n6. scout 不负责最终落盘；最终报告必须由 system_write_output 写入 wiki/research。\n7. 只输出 JSON 对象。"
        },
        "run_as": "llm",
        "runtime": "pi",
        "skills": [
          "external-research",
          "research-output-contract"
        ],
        "resource_bundle": {
          "input": "resource_bundle",
          "required": true
        },
        "output_contract": {
          "artifact_type": "json",
          "required": true,
          "schema_name": "external_research_scout_plan"
        }
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "input",
          "label": "Input",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "string",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "source_root",
