    {
      "id": "apply-scout-fanout",
      "type": "llm_mutation",
      "label": "Apply External Search Fanout",
      "description": "Deterministically compiles ScoutPlan.scouts[] into parallel external search/research LLM nodes.",
      "position": {
        "x": 1060,
        "y": -260
      },
      "config": {
        "generated": {
          "agent": "native",
          "inputs": {
            "resource_bundle": "{{nodes.resource-bundle.output}}"
          },
          "model": "minimax-cn/MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed",
          "output_artifact_type": "json",
          "prompt_template": "你是通用 external search/research 动态 scout。只输出 JSON，不要 Markdown。\n\nResourceBundle JSON：\n{{inputs.resource_bundle}}\n\nScoutAssignment JSON：\n{\n  \"id\": \"{{item.id}}\",\n  \"title\": \"{{item.title}}\",\n  \"goal\": \"{{item.goal}}\",\n  \"candidate_sources\": {{item.paths}}\n}\n\n任务：\n1. 围绕 ScoutAssignment.goal 自由探索外部来源；优先使用 ResourceBundle.data_sources.source_urls 和 candidate_sources。\n2. 可以跟进直接相关链接、GitHub/GitLab repo 文件、README/docs/examples/source files、release notes、论文、issue、官方文档、wiki 页面、新闻文章、监管/财务页面、行情数据页或数据集；必要时用 ResourceBundle.runtime.scratch_dir 做临时缓存。\n3. 必须区分 source fact 与 inference；不要编造文件路径、API 或功能。\n4. 每条关键 finding 必须尽量包含 source_anchors，使用 URL、repo file path、README section、commit/tag、paper/doc/issue/wiki/news/data anchor。\n5. 禁止写入最终研究报告；最终报告必须由 synthesize + system_write_output 写入 wiki/research。\n\n输出 JSON schema：\n{\"findings\":[{\"title\":string,\"summary\":string,\"source_anchors\":string[]}],\"risks\":string[],\"coverage_notes\":string[]}",
          "runtime": "pi",
          "skills": [
            "external-research",
            "research-output-contract"
          ],
          "resource_bundle": {
            "input": "resource_bundle",
            "required": true
          },
          "output_contract": {
            "artifact_type": "json",
            "required": true,
            "schema_name": "external_research_scout_output"
          }
        },
        "inputs": {
          "plan_input": "{{data.scout-plan-final.output}}"
        },
        "mode": "scout_fanout",
        "patch_target_source_ids": true,
        "target_node_id": "scout-output-final"
      },
      "pins": [
        {
          "id": "exec_in",
          "label": "In",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "id": "plan_input",
          "label": "Plan Input",
          "direction": "in",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "exec_out",
          "label": "Out",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "exec",
          "required": false
        },
        {
          "id": "mutation_artifact",
          "label": "Mutation Artifact",
          "direction": "out",
          "category": "data",
          "value_type": "json",
          "required": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
